PAGINATION

->Pagination is used to fetch data in small chunks(100 pages:fetch 1 at a time instead all
    at a time)
->it improves performance and reduces memory usage,especially for large datasets
->spring data jpa build in support for pageable and page

Request Flow:client->GET /employees?page=0&size=5->controller->service->db

get Api:

RestController
@RequestMapping("/employees")

public class EmployeeController{
@Autowired
EmployeeService employeeService;

@GetMapping
public ResponseEntity<Page<Employee> getAllEmployee(
                            @RequestParam(defaultValue = "0")int page,//starting of page
                            @RequestParam(defaultValue = "10")int size//give me 10 records,starts with 0
                        )
{
    Pageable pageable = PageRequest.of(page,size);
    Page<Employee> result = employeeService.getAllEmployee(pageable);
    return ResponseEntity.ok(result);

 }
}

